<title>USA: Evenhuis to resign as Lam Research CFO.</title>
<headline>Evenhuis to resign as Lam Research CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henk Evenhuis said Tuesday he will resign as executive vice president and chief financial officer of Lam Research Corp effective April 30.</p>
<p>He said he will serve as a consultant to the company through fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>The company said Evenhuis will play &quot;an active role&quot; on the committee that will select his successor.</p>
</text>
